===Noun===
'''[[one]]-[[horse]] [[town]]'''
#{{idiom}} A very [[small]] [[town]].
#:''It's surrounded by beautiful wilderness, but otherwise it's just a '''one-horse town'''.''

'A backwater where either the roads are too narrow, or the inhabitants' incomes are too meagre, to support large carriages requiring a team of two or more horses.' '